by amending paragraph (1) to read as follows:“(1) In general.—There are authorized to be appropriated to the Secretary to carry out this title—“(A) $87,520,000 for fiscal year 2021;
“(B) $91,900,000 for fiscal year 2022;
“(C) $96,500,000 for fiscal year 2023;
“(D) $101,325,000 for fiscal year 2024; and
“(E) $105,700,000 for fiscal year 2025.”

